"src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、自動販売機でパンを買ってみた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「   チョコカスター  」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ん？カスタードじゃなくて...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ、「カスター」って確かに書いてあるじゃあないか(･･;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カスターってなんだ？(ｰｰ;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...しばらく悩む。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし、辞書で調べてみよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「   カスター → キャスター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⇨ニュースキャスターの略。  」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お～(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！いやいやいや！そうじゃなくて、\nカスターだよカスター！(>_<)\nカスターって一体なんなんだよー\n何者なんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この、ただのチョコレートのかかった\n一見普通のパンにしか見えないパンに\n一体どんな秘密があるというのだ...((((；ﾟДﾟ)))))))ガクブル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こわいよーこわいよー（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、ここで負ける訳にはいかない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"命を燃やすんだ！井上、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうなったら\nカスターとやらを買ってみようじゃないか...！(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピッ ガシャッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ぱくっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・・・・・・・。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通のカスタード 入ってたぁぁぁああ～ヽ(；▽；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木坂って、どこ？では\nキャンプの料理回でした(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちのチームは、火おこし担当\nガイドのおじさん(生駒ちゃん^^ ) と、\n料理担当にわかれて、一人一品ずつ作ったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのほうとう、私が作ったんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、料理 とっても好きなんです＾＾"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外と家庭的でしょ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへ （笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"五人兄妹の四番目だからね(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダテにお兄ちゃんたちにこき使われてきてないですよ！（爆）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「もお～(＞＜;)！ 」とか言いながら\n結局、作るからね（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで、お兄ちゃんのバカっ(>_<)って\n思ってたけど、こんなところで\nチームに役立てるときがくるなんて、\n良かったです...(^_^;)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店で食べるほうとうみたい！なんて\nそんな...すごく嬉しかったです...\nすみません恐縮っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャンプのとこの景色(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きれい... ＋＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなとこに、いつか住みたいなっ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、番組終了後に発表がありましたが\n大阪、名古屋にてライヴをやります！＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベント出演とかじゃないですよ！\n乃木坂46のライヴです！\nミニライヴでもないですよ！\nずぅーっとやりたかったライヴ。(o^^o)くふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、今週の乃木坂浪漫で\nストーリーテラーやりますっ！(=^ω^=)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、月曜日から木曜日までの、\n 24:53～24:58 放送です(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら、見てみてください ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)     "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/30/3357176/0015.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-hed0d5a03ae":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます！\nななみです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n乃木坂46 と ぐるぐるカーテン を\n全国のみなさんに知ってもらおう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで\n選抜メンバーが朝方？夜中？から\n全国各地に散りました＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は仙台・札幌組に(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その場で知らされた\n地元 北海道行き！\n高まらない訳がない(*´д｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台はとまとの出身地だし、\n東北に行ったことがなかったので\nこの機会に初上陸！嬉しすぎた(*´д｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、仙台では乃木坂ってどこ\n放送されていないという事実…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちのこと知ってくださってる人がいるのか…\nすごく心配でした(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもなんと！CMやネットで\nたくさんの方が\n私たちを知ってくださっていて(;_;)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝早くから急なイベントだったのに関わらず\nお手紙やお土産までくださったり…\n本当にありがとうございました！！(;_;)＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感動したあぁ(;_;)\n仙台のみなさんありがとうございました！！！(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずんだもち、牛タン\nめっちゃ美味しかった！！！\nまた絶対行きます(*^o^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてダッシュで空港に向かい\n昼過ぎに北海道上陸！(o^_^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道に来たのは\n12月の全国キャラバンぶり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道の空気を吸って雪景色を見て\n帰ってきた！！\nって泣きそうになった。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の札幌はかなり吹雪いてて\nこりゃ人歩いてないんじゃないか？\nと不安を過ぎる\n千歳から札幌に向かう高速での私(+_+)…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいざ時計台前着いたら、\n屋根もない、寒い吹雪の中なのに\nTwitterを見て駆け付けてくれた\nファンのみなさんがいて\nわー！！！道民は本当に暖かすぎー！！！\nって思いました(;o;)！！＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかえりー！って言ってもらえて\nもう(´;ω;｀)ブワッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう私、本当に北海道大好きすぎて困る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台・札幌組は無事に\n時間内にミッションを終えて\n夜ご飯には北海道の海鮮を戴いて\n東京に帰着しました(*^.^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のイベントに協力してくれた\n仙台・札幌のみなさん！\n本当にありがとうございました(>_<)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪、新潟、京都、名古屋、\n福岡、広島のみなさんも\nありがとうございました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Twitterでもたくさんの情報、お返事\nとても嬉しかったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道から飛行機が離陸したとき\n北海道や地元が恋しすぎて\n泣いたのは内緒。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木坂ってどこ？は\n私まだ見てないので\n見てからまたブログ書きますね(o^_^o)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では今日も頑張りましょう〜('-'*)！"}],"source":"archive"}}